---
# Mirrors .claude/rules/coding_style.md: Google C++ Style Guide baseline,
# with 4-space indentation, a 100-column limit, and pointers/references
# bound to the type rather than the variable name.
BasedOnStyle: Google
Standard: c++20

IndentWidth: 4
ContinuationIndentWidth: 4
AccessModifierOffset: -4
ColumnLimit: 100

PointerAlignment: Left
ReferenceAlignment: Left
DerivePointerAlignment: false

BreakBeforeBraces: Attach
SpaceBeforeParens: ControlStatements

MaxEmptyLinesToKeep: 1
